From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] tinyplay: use pcm_drain instead of pcm_wait before close

pcm_wait() waits for buffer space (POLLOUT) and returns immediately when
there is room to write. Replace with pcm_drain() which waits for the
hardware to finish playing all buffered data before closing.

---
 utils/tinyplay.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/utils/tinyplay.c b/utils/tinyplay.c
--- a/utils/tinyplay.c
+++ b/utils/tinyplay.c
@@ -494,7 +494,7 @@
         printf("Remains %zu bytes.\n", remaining_data_size);
     }
 
-    pcm_wait(ctx->pcm, -1);
+    pcm_drain(ctx->pcm);
 
     free(buffer);
     return 0;
